  "prefLabel": "Env-C 214.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-C 214.01 Purpose. The purpose of these rules is to establish requirements to implement the Cross-Media Electronic Reporting Rule (CROMERR), 40 CFR Part 3, 2018 edition, promulgated by the United States Environmental Protection Agency (EPA).\n\nSource. #12880, eff 9-30-19",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-c200.html"
